   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Closeup of Form 1099-NEC and 1099-MISC. The IRS has reintroduced Form 1099-NEC as the new way to report self-employment income instead of Form 1099-MISC as traditionally had been used.</rdf:li>
